      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_2",
      "label": "User projected onto the text 'me' as the speaker",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'when someone asks me how many chromosomes i have', where 'me' is a deictic pronoun referring to the speaker. The user identifies with the speaker role, and the chromosome visual is the embodiment of this speaker. The projection is onto the text, which contains the deictic 'me' that anchors the user's identity to the scene.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
