      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_3",
      "label": "User projected onto the text 'you' as the audience",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'more than you', where 'you' is a deictic pronoun referring to the audience or the person being compared. The user identifies with the speaker ('me') and positions the audience ('you') as the object of comparison. This projection is onto the text, which contains the deictic 'you' that defines the social relationship in the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
